{"title":"2025 Putnam A Problems","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problems\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problems</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Problem_A1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem A1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Problem_A2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem A2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Problem_A3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem A3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Problem_A4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem A4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Problem_A5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem A5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Problem_A6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem A6</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problems\">Problems</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_A_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problems\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_A1\">Problem A1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_A_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Problem A1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/e/9be21ff7f9b5b772faee8b3643b9c88a49e077fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"22\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/f/b2f0c6d216bb63a89845904c513ec0007b6b3e7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /> be distinct positive integers. For each positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/d/8ed417fc2fad9904404efe4ec38ac508d3d64618.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/5/a65540896dbfc5605e7767c8cacaa9d429e14d11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> to be the relatively prime positive integers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfbc0849fa5876d0541faa8f15abc854a8cfbdfb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{m_k}{n_k}=\\frac{2m_{k-1}+1}{2n_{k-1}+1}.\\]\" width=\"139\" height=\"39\" />Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/9/3a92ad8f3feadbebe6fb4bcba22da2292a0ab2e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2m_k+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/f/61f412fc700dae8de269691e45736182fb99da5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2n_k+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" /> are relatively prime for infinitely many positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 Putnam A Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_A2\">Problem A2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_A_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Problem A2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the largest real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and the smallest real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/e/e7e63c459d041f7929a26b3c220ab9b83f4a1d65.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ax(\\pi - x)\\le \\sin x \\le bx(\\pi - x)\\]\" width=\"236\" height=\"18\" />for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in the real interval <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/e/ece27ba559bd93cdf2416aa0f88fc8d7d85e5791.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[0,\\pi]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 Putnam A Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_A3\">Problem A3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_A_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Problem A3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Alice and Bob play a game with a string of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> digits, each of which is restricted to be either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Initially all are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. A legal move is to add or subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> from one digit to create a string not created before. A player with no legal move loses, and the other player wins. Alice goes first, and alternating moves occur. For each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/0/340797a8fa9f1a06b10ce9e764998830b15ca755.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\ge1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, determine who has a strategy guaranteeing victory.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 Putnam A Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_A4\">Problem A4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_A_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Problem A4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the minimum possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> such that there exist <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78db23e86da8fe319c63bdb5eaf6d3fd8fefa17b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />-by-<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> matrices <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/4/f946e09a50766d0e6b4ba7999edb586dd9ddc8b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_1, \\ldots,A_{2025}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"104\" height=\"18\" /> with the property that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/3/93339ee70d52a0e15aa6e64d4733c9dfa2bb5cf9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[A_iA_j=A_jA_i\\]\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" />if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/e/e8e6645b2737889ba2572698f58add8bd54b1f5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|i-j|\\in\\{0,1,2024\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"160\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 Putnam A Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_A5\">Problem A5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_A_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Problem A5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/f/53f12ec5ee4a2e5304810da76fbb60e0d3cf46c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\ge2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> be an integer. For a sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce4a06b4fa22dc35ae3be72de5903416d9830fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s=(s_1,\\ldots,s_{n-1})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"140\" height=\"20\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26e82c7b0d7d9745c9e175ac80a28d9be4e478d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_i=\\pm 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"17\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/e/4fe5a0767d0ef2863560208aafad9fcf14519053.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(s)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> denote the number of permutations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/5/8c5359e3493b06283995b7e103a15634f4d14752.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_1, \\ldots,a_n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/1/741b0d455066ae83b72e54352f8558639b172e3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1, 2, \\ldots, n\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/2/f726d882c0b0b0a5abb555722cb493f229cbb0bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_i(a_{i+1}-a_i)&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" />. For each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, determine all sequences <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/e/4fe5a0767d0ef2863560208aafad9fcf14519053.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(s)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is maximal.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 Putnam A Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_A6\">Problem A6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_A_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Problem A6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/b/18b6b523413e7da3eea99cc80491857890718238.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_0=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" /> and, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/1/9013bb191380c197d4fbea9ef176b90631bde0bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\ge0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/c/e8c39e2cc8f5265eafebef6ff1a8dc0fbdbca764.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_{n+1}=2b_n^2+b_n+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"21\" />. Show that, for each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/8/518773c4c14231c816d4656a6180e1391cbf308d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\ge1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/b/4db2f5d5cf201d977aefebc68505f73928c9ca44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_{2^k+1}-2b_{2^k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"95\" height=\"19\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/c/42cea975b7b40c30a0b8fa716bd9f3ec63758e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2k+2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" /> but not by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/a/d5a89cdf4742f0dccfe0525656b886f56086cf8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2k+3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 Putnam A Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017100645\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 241/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8130/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36828:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017100645 and revision id 284706. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}